	(text_box "Power ON: configure SOFT_PWR as output, set high, and POWER_SW as input with pullup.\n\nPower OFF: if POWER_SW is pressed (active low) for programmed period of time (e.g. 1 sec), configure POWER_SW as output, set high and set SOFT_PWR to low.\nIMPORTANT: MCU must enter SHUTDOWN mode (where voltage supervisor is not enabled) otherwise power off RESET will be triggered and stop power off sequence!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
